Package: ObservaBio
Title: ObservaBio Darwin Core Standardization and Biodiversity Validation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Rogerio", "Nunes Oliveira", email = "rogerio.onza@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny-as-package application (PT-BR UI) that standardizes species
    lists to Darwin Core and validates names against Brazilian botanical and
    zoological authorities (Flora do Brasil, Fauna do Brasil) with a live GBIF
    backbone fallback. Cross-checks conservation status (MMA + IUCN) and runs a
    geographic verification (10 km buffer + GBIF occurrences + state/biome) to
    flag species distribution. Ships embedded reference bases and a modular
    provider contract so new authorities can be added without touching the engine.
